<title>USA: CBOT soybean deliveries - Sept 5.</title>
<headline>CBOT soybean deliveries - Sept 5.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delivery notices against the September soybean contract for September 6 (In thousand bushels).</p>
<p>SOYBEANS - 65. Up to July 2, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - AG Edwards/c 45, FCC/c 10, RJ O'Brien/c 10.</p>
<p>Received - 1st Option/c 25, Rosenthal Collins Group/c 40.</p>
<p>H=house account. C=Customer Account.</p>
<p>Source: Chicago Board of Trade Clearing Corp.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
